||| Display width of characters in terminal cells (0, 1 or 2).
||| The tables are a compact subset of Unicode's East Asian Width (W/F) and
||| of the combining/format characters; they follow wcwidth(3) conventions.
||| See libs/termui/doc/design.md for what is deliberately not handled
||| (grapheme clusters, emoji ZWJ sequences).
